      "value": "Update: Playstation's partnership program is 2 sign up applications and they even do special services if you ask on the forma.\n\nThey prefer you partner with them 9months to 1 year before launch to get a proper back and forth\n\nYou even get a free dev kit\n\nIt would be wise to try at least one more time now that the Avatar market and better unity support for the PS5 has made it faster to compile for PS5\n\nhttps://youtu.be/3BBZpRWQLo0",
